sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant AuthorService
    participant SpringFramework as Spring Framework
    participant ResourceExceptionHandler
    participant StandardError

    Client->>AuthorService: Request
    activate AuthorService
    AuthorService->>AuthorService: throw ObjectNotFoundException
    Note right of AuthorService: Exception ObjectNotFoundException is thrown from service layer
    deactivate AuthorService

    AuthorService-->>SpringFramework: exception propagates
    Note right of SpringFramework: Spring framework intercepts exception
    activate SpringFramework

    SpringFramework->>ResourceExceptionHandler: route to objectNotFound method
    Note right of ResourceExceptionHandler: ControllerAdvice routes to objectNotFound method
    activate ResourceExceptionHandler

    ResourceExceptionHandler->>ResourceExceptionHandler: extract exception details and request URI
    Note right of ResourceExceptionHandler: Method extracts exception details and request URI

    ResourceExceptionHandler->>StandardError: new StandardError(timestamp, status, message, path)
    Note right of StandardError: StandardError object is created with timestamp, status code, message, and request URI
    activate StandardError
    StandardError-->>ResourceExceptionHandler: StandardError instance
    deactivate StandardError

    ResourceExceptionHandler-->>Client: ResponseEntity.status(404).body(error)
    Note right of Client: Response is serialized and sent to client
    deactivate ResourceExceptionHandler
    deactivate SpringFramework
